## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.

# Secrets / environment
.env

# User-specific files
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Bb]uild/
